The policy states that "Verification credibility status is established if a firm generates turnover of at least 10,000,000 USD per year, holds a commercial banking charter, or maintains an international credit rating of at least 75 points."

This translates to three alternative groups (OR conditions):
- **Group 1**: Turnover ≥ 10,000,000 USD
- **Group 2**: Holds a commercial banking charter
- **Group 3**: International credit rating ≥ 75 points

