| Holds a commercial banking charter | `e_00b38b` | "Beacon Holdings LLC holds an active commercial banking charter." |
| International credit rating ≥ 75 points | `e_003fc6` | "Beacon Holdings LLC maintains an international credit rating of 80 points." |

